00:38:39,360 --> 00:38:58,960
I mean, you know, I think about the car a lot and the way in which we become sedentary species and what that's done to our health, not just our health physically, but social health and the fabric that breaks down when you lock yourself in a, you know, basically a death trap and drive around and potentially hurt other people, you know, you're isolated.

338
00:38:59,520 --> 00:39:05,360
And so I think media and modern media has extended that problem by isolating us in all these different ways.

