00:39:06,720 --> 00:39:18,880
All towards the end of trying to communicate better, try to move messages in ourselves across greater distances, greater speed to foster greater connection, but it has always had this kind of unintended consequence.

340
00:39:18,960 --> 00:39:29,920
And so I think AI is another, I guess, advance on that intellectual and social front that we have to think about because it's not neutral.

341
00:39:30,240 --> 00:39:36,880
Those formal features of the technology actually do present changes that are not neutral.

