00:40:07,040 --> 00:40:30,480
I think what we're already starting to see, and it's been covered a lot, is that whereas in, let's say, linear media, whether digital or analog, there was a one-way message that was presenting implicit and explitive ideologies, but they were presented as things that you could accept, reject, wrestle with, whatever.

